// the Kummer series F_M = exp(-T) SUM_k (2T)^k / ((2M+1)(2M+3)...(2M+2k+1)),
// every term positive, summed until it no longer changes the sum, and
// downward, F_m = (2T F_(m+1) + exp(-T)) / (2m+1). Its accuracy on
